window.products.push({"id":405259,"name":"HYOOLA Red Three Wick Large Candle - 4.75 x 8 Inch - Unscented Big Pillar Candles - 120 Hour - European Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71glsvcEQdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hyoola European Large Candles are the perfect addition to any occasion, creating a warm and inviting ambiance that lights up any environment. About This Product: - 3 wick candle  - Extra large candle  - Made In The EU by A Brand You Can Trust  - Packed securely in a cardboard box  - Lead-free 100% Cotton Wick, non-toxic  - Unscented three wick candle  - Dripless candle  - Indoor / Outdoor Use  - Bright Red candles  - 120 Hour Burn Time  - High Grade Paraffin Wax Great For Decorating Special Events Such As - Dining Room And Living Room  - Weddings  - Holiday Dinners  - Home Decor  - Parties  - Spa's  - Cozy nights at home while relaxing  - Bath Candle Set  - Event planners  - Emergency Candles For Blackouts ▪️ 4.75-inch diameter x 8-inch hight (120mm x 200mm) Burrning Tips: How to Burn Pillar Candles - The first time you burn your candle, leave it lit long enough so that a wax pool forms across the majority of the top portion of the candle. This is called a full pool. - When wax pool reaches the candle's edge, extinguish flame and allow candle to harden before relighting. This will prevent dripping. - Discontinue use when 1/2\" of wax remains at the bottom. - Trim the wick to ¼ inch before each burn. Invest in the best! Hyoola Decorative Pillars are made from Natural wax to ensure premium quality. Since its initial use, the candle has undergone an enormous development. Although it is no longer the most important light source of mankind, its popularity remains unbroken. Candles symbolize solemnity, stand for romance, calm the senses and set accents in decoration – a warm and wonderful sparkle to the delight of all. Ignite your creativity with Hyoola Candles ! Great quality materials mixed with incredible utility will brighten up your days!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71glsvcEQdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B08FHFZVSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-405259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FHFZVSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FHFZVSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
