window.products.push({"id":405353,"name":"Seutgjie Kids Alarm Clock OK to Wake Sleep Training with Night Light Sound Machine Dual Display Child Lock Bunny Digital Alarm Clock for Toddlers Boys","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aQ8Lr5-kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sleep trainer clock for toddlers kids: with night light, Sun/Moon icon and facial expressions. Half an hour before bedtime, rabbit ears will turn blue. Kids can get ready for bed. At bedtime, the rabbit's ear light will automatically turn off, the moon icon will appear, the rabbit's eyes will close, and the screen will automatically adjust to the darkest. Ok to wake clock for kids toddler: Half an hour before it is time to wake up, rabbit ears will glow yellow, signaling it's almost time to start the day. When it will turn green, it is time to wake up! The cute alarm clock will ring. The sun icon will appear and the rabbit's eyes will open. Intelligent and adjustable: Child safety lock feature, prevent children from accidentally changing the alarm clock time. Dual alarms and snooze modes, short press the overhead button to take a 10 minute snooze for many times. 12/24 hour format. 5 Diﬀerent alarm rings, 3 adjustable volume settings. Funny rabbit alarm clock: There are 3 kinds of rabbit expressions. The rabbit opens its eyes during the day, closes its eyes when sleeping, and half opens its eyes when snooze. The facial expression changes three times per 60 seconds in the daytime after turning on sleep trainer function. The rabbit's ears are two night lights with four colors and adjustable brightness. You can set specific colors and brightness. You can also set the night light to be normally on or automatically off after 10min/20min/30min/45min/1h/1h30min. Sound machine and nap timer: The wake up clock can play three melody, four natural sounds and a white noise. The playback can run continuously or stop automatically after a set time. You can set the countdown of 10min/30min/45min/1h/1h30min/2h/2h30min/3h. When the time is up, you can set the kids digital clock to sound or the rabbit ear to light up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aQ8Lr5-kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seutgjie","source_asin":"B0BPBHB93D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-405353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPBHB93D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPBHB93D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
