window.products.push({"id":405420,"name":"Wax Melts Warmer Electric Ceramic Oil Burner 3-in-1 Candle Wax Cube Tart Melter Warmer Scented Fragrance Aroma Burner for Home Office Bedroom Aromathe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hzrhwfYzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ceramic 【A thing of beauty is a joy forever】 Professional designers combined with the characteristics of traditional ceramic craftsmanship and ink painting, designed this unique wax melts warmer. The golden lines of stunning gold foil are spread out on the smooth surface of the strengthened ceramic oil burner, which stand for those memorable, glorious and colourful days in one’s life. Choose this wax melts burner, enjoy fragrance and happiness in your daily life! 【High quality is our top priority】 Worried about flames and smoke produced by scented candles? Tired of repeated changing bulbs for ordinary candle wax burner? Perplexed by those poor tealight or diffuser with too strong or faint fragrance? Try this electric wax warmer! Our ceramic fragrance warmer has compact size with removable dish, safe, convenient and save time and space. Long lasting and appropriate aroma eliminates odor for bedroom, bathroom, office, garage, kitchen, basement. 【Easy and safe operation for first-time user】 Just plug the electric oil burner in, put some wax cubes on the tray, then turn on the switch. Everything done! Stable melting temperature will soon fully turn the wax into liquid and the scent permeates through the room, first-time user friendly, very safe for kids, elder and pets. The complete melting time of soybean wax is around 45-60 minutes, and the complete melting time of beeswax is around 75-90 minutes, all at room temperature. 【Functional and environmental friendly wax warmer】 Use candle jar with/without wick directly on the iron heating plate; Use scented wax cubes or essential oils on the removable ceramic dish, and there will be no flame, soot, or other pollutants, no safety hazards caused by burning flames. Low power consumption and environmentally friendly materials as well as packages make this scented fragrance aroma burner an ideal choice for environmentalist. 【Gratitude is the main source of happiness】 Our wax melts warmer burner is the perfect option to express gratitude to your beloved ones and treat yourself. The style of this ceramic wax melts burner is neutral enough to fit any room, perfect decoration and fragrance choice for perfume lovers. Take this fragrance wax warmer burner to show you sincere care and love for them on Mothers' Day, Valentine's Day, anniversary, house-warming, wedding, birthday, party and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hzrhwfYzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dialan's","source_asin":"B09LPZF971","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-405420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LPZF971","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LPZF971","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
