window.products.push({"id":405776,"name":"HOOPLE Small Stall Shower Curtain, 70 x 40 inch Narrow Half Size Waffle Weave Cloth Fabric Shower Curtains, Water Repellent, Washable Bathroom Curtain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ool5rDgmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【NOTE】: If your shower stall or bathtub opening is 150cm (height) x 80cm (width), then a curtain with a size of 180cm (height) x 100cm (width) /70x 40 inches can be used. Applying for bathrooms with shower stalls or bathtub shower combinations that have openings that are smaller than or equal to its dimensions. 【Hoople Black Shower Curtain】: Height 180cm Width 100cm/70*40 inch. Hoople bathroom curtain boasts a luscious, cotton-like texture, thanks to its heavyweight fabric with 240 GSM (grams per square meter). Crafted with 100% premium polyester fabric, this shower curtain is remarkably durable and sturdy, perfect for elevating the ambiance of hotel, family, master and guest bathrooms alike. 【Keep Your Privacy Well】: Hoople bath shower curtain delivers exquisite privacy, thanks to its thick and opaque design that shields you from prying eyes while you shower. Our black bath shower curtain can be used as a stand-alone curtain or paired with a liner for added assurance, catering to your unique preferences. 【Excellent Drape】: Hoople black shower curtain adds a luxurious thickness to your shower experience, allowing it to drape seamlessly around you. The curtain's own weight keeps it anchored, preventing it from floating around and swaying, while its robust fabric and tight hem minimize the risk of shrinkage and deformation. 【Water Repellent & Non-Fading】: Hoople shower curtain for the bathroom features a water-repellent fabric and quick-drying material, ensuring that water beads roll off its smooth surface with ease, without sticking or causing unsightly color fading. This makes it a perfect choice for keeping your bathroom dry and clean. 【Easy to Maintain】: Hoople shower curtains are incredibly easy to maintain, as they can be machine-washed in cold water on a gentle cycle, and then tumble-dried for added convenience. This means that you can enjoy a fresh and hygienic shower curtain with minimal effort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ool5rDgmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOOPLE","source_asin":"B0BFR43CC2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-405776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFR43CC2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFR43CC2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
