window.products.push({"id":405923,"name":"CGOLDENWALL Manual Meat Slicer Meat Bone Cutter Machine Chinese Medicine Jerky Slicer Rib Chicken Fish Frozen Meat Vegetables Deli Food Slicing Machin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dzk1HIoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SMALL SIZE & SPACE SAVING--Working table: 240*148mm(9.4*5.83\"), blade length: 190mm(7.48\"), weight: 1.8kg(3.97lb). Small and exquisite and will not occupy too much space on your cooking table. And precisely because of its small size, we must honestly tell you that it cannot cut whole chickens. We recommend larger KD0288 Meat Cutter can cut whole chickens(B0822JBL4Y) CUTTING TIPS--Our meat cutter can cut meat with SMALL ribs and bones. It CANNOT cut beef short ribs, beef bones, trotters, large ribs, larger bones or very hard frozen meat. For fresh meat, direct cutting may cause adhesion, you could freeze the meat for A LITTLE WHILE before cutting.**For food with bones or materials with greater hardness, please place the material near the cutter head and cut with an instant force, which more labor-saving. 403 STAINLESS STEEL, THICK BLADE--The blade is forged and polished with 403 steel at high temperature, has a smooth surface and is easy to clean, can be washed in water and mild detergent directly. But no matter how sharp the blade is, improper use will not get the desired result! So before cutting, you can sharpen the blade, please place the hard ingredients near the cutter head and cut with an instant force! FREE GIFT FOR YOU--In addition to the machine, food storage shovel and knife sharpener are also included in the package. Food storage shovel is used to store cut food to avoid messy table and saving you much time to organize the table. The knife will inevitably become dull after a long time using or cutting hard materials, but we have prepared a sharpening stick for you! CUTTING THICKNESS CONTROL--Precision calibration is engraved on the cutting panel, and the thickness of the slice can be accurately adjusted according to the calibration (0-45mm).Choose the most proper slice thickness for different kinds of ingredients. BUT! It is not recommended to slice frozen meat rolls, because this cutter has no baffle to fix very hard frozen meat which is easy to slide!( KD0288 Meat Cutter can cut frozen meat roll(B0822JBL4Y))","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dzk1HIoAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CGOLDENWALL","source_asin":"B0833X4MFT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-405923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0833X4MFT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0833X4MFT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
