window.products.push({"id":405936,"name":"Kook 8 oz Porcelain Ramekins, Oven Safe, For Baking Pot Pies, Creme Brulee. Lava Cake, Set of 6 (Bay Leaf)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a5SqJX1OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ Pies, Pudding and Beyond! These ramekins are perfect for cooking individual servings of crème brulee, French onion soup, soufflé, casseroles and more! They can also be used to serve nuts, pretzels and other party snacks. ✔️ These baking dishes can go straight from the oven to table. They’re also freezer, broiler, microwave and dishwasher safe for maximum convenience. ✔️ Designed with elegant, smooth ceramic in five different colors. This durable material easily wipes clean and retains heat so food stays warm between cooking and serving. ✔️ Each dish holds 8 ounces at full capacity and 6 ounces standard capacity. ✔️ We carefully package each item with custom polyfoam molds to ensure it arrives in perfect condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a5SqJX1OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KooK","source_asin":"B08R96F5HK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-405936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R96F5HK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R96F5HK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":405937,"name":"Howard Miller Jennison Wall Clock 612-221 – Vintage Mahogany Finish, Vintage Home Decor, Brass-Finished Lyre Pendulum, Key-Wound, Triple-Chime Movemen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KMTmsGyhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WALL CLOCK: This Jennison Chiming Wall Clock in a Vintage Mahogany finish is constructed from select hardwoods and veneers to compliment your home decor. Featuring a carved, scalloped shell pediment, this timepiece includes a polished brass lyre pendulum that swings by a beat plate. DURABLE: This beautiful wall clock has a sturdy frame that will relieve stress in a busy household. It features a polished Viennese dial that is overlaid with a center disk with an enameled finish, has decorative hands, and Arabic numerals. CHIME MOVEMENT: Ensure time precision with a high-precision key-wound, triple-chime movement that plays your choice of Westminster, St. Michael, or Whittington ¼, ½, and ¾ chimes accordingly with a full chime and strike on the hour. It has an industry exclusive dual-ratchet winding arbor that ensures safe movement winding. DIMENSIONS: This Howard Miller clock has a height of 33.5 inches (85 cm) tall, with a width of 14.75 inches (3 cm) and a depth of 7.5 inches (19 cm). The key-wound, triple-chime movement offers durable bronze bushings and a chime silence option to place in any room in your home. Made in the USA. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world's leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine, and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KMTmsGyhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B000YDKBP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-405937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000YDKBP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000YDKBP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
