window.products.push({"id":405988,"name":"Morgan Home Velvet Plush Reverse to Sherpa Blanket - Big Blanket for Cozy and Warm Bed or Couch (Twilight Polar Bear, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912Y01GzwzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"200 GSM ON BOTH VELVET PLUSH AND SHERPA SIDE: With a 2\" Bonded and Folded Edge, these blankets are sure to be durable, long lasting and effective all throughout the winter. It also features a ribbon tie with front tile card, making it the perfect gift for holidays or going back to school! STUDENTS NEED ALL SEASON MANUFACTURING : Be prepared for a snowy winter with this essential dorm room item. These blankets will bring you maximum comfort no matter what. A lightweight velvet plushmain side that reverses to warm and cozy sherpa ensures this school year will be the best yet. DURABLE FOR ANY ROOM IN THE HOUSE: These blankets will fit in perfectly in any room. Whether it's lounging out on the couch with some hot cocoa watching TV, playing your favorite games or even to just sleep in bed, your comfort level won't be compromised. You'll have a blast folding it up and take it camping with you for some campfire songs! MACHINE WASHABLE: Machine wash cold with like colors. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low. Remove promptly from dryer. OEKO-TEX CERTIFIED: These blankets are OEKO-TEX certified as non-hazardous for long lasting comfort and a stress free rest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912Y01GzwzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Morgan Home","source_asin":"B0BBJGNJ56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-405988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBJGNJ56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBJGNJ56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":405989,"name":"DOQAUS Ice Cube Trays 4 Pack, Easy-Release Silicone & Flexible 14-Ice Cube Trays with Spill-Resistant Removable Lid, LFGB Certified and BPA Free, for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lR6K3scfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stronger & Safety: Made of premium silicone and PP material. Bpa-free and pass food-grade LFGB certification! DOQAUS 4 ice tray sets use better materials and designs to make the ice trays stronger and more durable. They can withstand long-term low-temperature storage without breaking. No longer worry about breaking easily. Stop wasting your money! Start to use DOQAUS ice trays and say goodbye to those cheap disposable ice trays! Easy Ice Removal: Silicone ice cube trays with lid use TPE material and the bottom wider design, which makes it easy to release ice cubes and the soft silicone material will not break after freezing for a long time. Each flat cube compartment is separate from others so you can easily push from the bottom. No need for awkward bending or twisting, removing the ice cube isn't a tough job anymore! Lids Lifter Designed: So as to be more convenient to use removable lids, each cover is designed with two lid lifter. This humanized ice tray allows you to make perfect size ice cubes while preventing spills and the freezing of excess water and keeps ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors. Moreover, these easy-release trays stack easily and neatly in the freezer without sticking. Each tray makes 14 nice-sized cubes for a total of 56 (Each capacity of 27 ml or 1 ounce). Easy to Use & Dishwasher Safe: Fill the trays with water, cover the lid on, and then slip the trays into the freezer. Besides water, you can fill the ice cube trays silicone with fruits, ice cream, soda, cocktail, whisky, vodka, ice coffee, and wine to customize your favorite flavor. And you can simply put them into your dishwasher after use. Muti-Colors & Good Customer Service: Designed with white and green colors to bring a more pleasant ice-making and ice drinks experience! Silicone ice cube tray kits are great for home, parties, bars, gifts, etc. If the ice cube trays didn't work well for you, please contact us and be willing to provide a better solution for every dear customer! All your questions will be replied to within 24hrs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lR6K3scfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOQAUS","source_asin":"B0BZRXNXC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-405989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZRXNXC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZRXNXC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
