window.products.push({"id":406001,"name":"ZMEIJU 3 Inch Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper Twin Size,Premium Soft Pressure Relief Mattress,Sleep Innovations Mattress Topper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71woIw7HnGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☀ Memory foam mattress material ☀ The ZMEIJU 3-inch memory mattress is made from 30D(about 2lb/m3) high density aero-grade memory foam. The memory foam is decompression, slow rebound, breathable . Enhance your sleep comfort and promote deep sleep. ☀ The advantages of foam mattress ☀ The 3-inch foam mattress can absorb and break down the pressure of the human body and change the softness and hardness according to the temperature of the human body. It perfectly fits the contour of the body and brings the feeling of pressure-free fitting. At the same time, it provides effective support to the body. Improve your sleep quality. ☀ Mattress certification standard ☀ Our mattress tops are CertiPUR-US certified and use OEKO-Tex Standard 100 covered fabric. Our memory foam mattresses are vacuum packed and in boxes. ☀ Memory foam mattress design details ☀ There are 4 adjustable elastic bands at the four corners of 25cm, the adjustable range is 8in-16in, the width is about 2.5cm, with PP day button. The wireless head in the seam, smooth zipper without stuck. ☀ Mattress cloth ☀ Skin friendly breathable bamboo fiber, quilted stripes. The back is white polyester anti-slip bottom to prevent sliding. Zipper switch for easy removal and cleaning. Note: It is normal for new foam to have a slight odor; It is completely harmless and will dissipate in a short time with regular use. Before first use, lay the top of the mattress flat in a ventilated area and allow it to expand for 48-72 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71woIw7HnGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZMEIJU","source_asin":"B0BN9TN3TX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN9TN3TX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN9TN3TX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
